<meta name='title' content="6FUW zinc site: CPSF30 fingers 1-3 on the AAUAAA signal (supersedes 6FBS)"/>
<meta name='description' content="cryo-EM 3.07 A. Model 1 as deposited. One unit is one angstrom. A bond to zinc glows only while it measures under 2.5 angstrom. Materials, lights, radii and the cage faces are look, not data."/>
